title: Underground
subtitle: The party is banned. Keep it alive.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: rf_mass
view-if: rf_underground_timer <= 0 and party_banned = 1
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rf_underground_timer = 1

= Underground

The offices are sealed and the paper is banned. Members meet in flats and allotment huts.

- @cells
- @paper

@cells
title: Rebuild the organisation cell by cell.
subtitle: Saves members. Strengthens the apparatus and <span class="f-stalin">Thälmann</span>.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.lean(Q, {stalin: 2});
Q.members += 6;
Q.apparatus += 3;
!}

Small groups meet in secret and keep paying dues. The organisation survives in a harder form.

@paper
title: Print an illegal Rote Fahne.
subtitle: Saves some members. Pleases the <span class="f-left">Left</span>.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.lean(Q, {left: 3});
Q.members += 3;
Q.repression += 3;
!}

Illegal leaflets and papers circulate in the factories. The police seize some presses, but the party's voice is still heard.
